      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Flow 1 — the clock\n\n10 cron rules covering all 46 weekly slots:\n\n- `5 12 * * 1-6`  Mon-Sat 12:05\n- `30 13 * * 1-6`  Mon-Sat 13:30\n- `5 13 * * 0`  Sun 13:05\n- `30 14 * * 0`  Sun 14:30\n- `23 15 * * *`  daily 15:23\n- `0 16 * * 5,6`  Fri-Sat 16:00\n- `0 19 * * *`  daily 19:00\n- `30 20 * * *`  daily 20:30\n- `20 21 * * *`  daily 21:20\n- `0 23 * * 5,6`  Fri-Sat 23:00\n\n**Timezone is set on the workflow** (Settings -> Timezone = America/Santiago). If that is wrong every slot lands 4 hours off.\n\nSet **Publicar -> Workflow** to the \"Social — Publicador\" workflow after you import it.",
